>\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/19529988/in-the-mood-for-love\" target=\"\">In The Mood For Love</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>2000</span>                                        <span>98mins</span>                                        <span>Hong Kong</span>                                        <span>(PG)</span>                                        <span>Romance</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Wong Kar Wai</span>                                        <span>Starring Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Maggie Cheung, Rebecca Pan, Lai Chen, Paulyn Sun</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>In 1962 Hong Kong, neighbors Su Li-zhen (Mrs. Chan) and Chow Mo-wan (Mr. Chow) discover their spouses are having an affair. As they spend time together, they develop feelings for each other, but their relationship remains chaste and unspoken, reflecting societal constraints and their own moral compass.</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Saturday 11th July</div>                                                <li class=\"w-short\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharle