                             <div class=\"movietag\"><span class=\"tag 35mm\">35mm</span>                                                    </div>\n                                                </li>                                        </ul>          \n                                    </div>\n                                </div></div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"jacro-event movie-tabs row sub 4k\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12\">\n                            <div class=\"film_list-outer\">\n                                <div class=\"film_img\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617401/angels-egg\">\n                                       <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"filmimg\" src=\"https://cdn.taposapp.com/poster/600x900/afBZeJ-2BYldxaaJ2LJg7Njyh2XHMiPu36duKRMuxeE.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"150\" height=\"210\" onError=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://princecharlescinema.com/wp-content/plugins/jacro-plugin/images/default.png';\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"jacrofilm-list-content\">\n                                    <a class=\"liveeventtitle\" href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/film/31617401/angels-egg\" target=\"\">Angel&#039;s Egg</a>\n                                    <div class=\"running-time\">\n                                        <span>1985</span>                                        <span>71mins</span>                                        <span>Japan</span>                                        <span>(15)</span>                                        <span>Anime</span>                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"film-info\">\n                                        <span>Directed by Mamoru Oshii</span>                                        <span>Starring Keiichi Noda, Mako Hyodo, Jinpachi Nezu</span>                                    </div>\n                                                                        <div class=\"jacro-formatted-text\"><p><p>In an underwater city, a young girl takes care of a large egg she holds carefully in her arms. A boy with a gun arrives in search of a bird he saw in his dream. At first, it seems as if feelings of sympathy are developing between the two.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Forty years after the film&rsquo;s original release, Anime Limited is proud to present an all-new 4K restoration of the film, supervised by director Mamoru Oshii, in cinemas nationwide for the very first time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The film is a creative collaboration between acclaimed director Mamoru Oshii (Ghost in the Shell), who wrote and directed the feature, and revered artist Yoshitaka Amano (Final Fantasy, Vampire Hunter D). The film beautifully intertwines Oshii&rsquo;s thematic reflections on philosophy and theology with Amano&rsquo;s distinctive ink painting style, culminating in an arrestingly beautiful hand-drawn allegorical fantasy.</p></p></div>\n                                    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!--- show time --->\n                                                                    <div class=\"performance-list-items-outer\">\n                                        <ul class=\"performance-list-items\"><div class=\"heading\">Sunday 12th July</div>                                                <li class=\"4k sub\">\n                                                    \n                                                                                                           <a href=\"https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627192\" class=\"film_book_button\">\n                                                            <span class=\"hover\">Book</span>\n     